&_nc_oc=AdqB_GTy6ePrRMtlfr57MmfJkB6mzqaG2rqH_eA94PmvX05wve2Ip2PxIGIgNcfaCB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af55_EcMyNioQHqcKPqEL0OvtiJ2BkmxX3DaEcIjCe2UZg&oe=6A20453E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ujbU78UaPRsQ7kNvwEcPoKL&_nc_oc=Adpk_h_vjltomk4z2y7MtBd3bEXmtcaZiTTP2X0tFME6PXaLqDMq68Cy_pKgAIQ8VME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Ook3Biz01AjhCtdLx6BDQgqGiNygwOFxUtaD4uCgnjg&oe=6A201DFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iBzcp691aoAQ7kNvwH4H53w&_nc_oc=Adq6VsnRP47Kn-caUH1amSSY3DaECeP-GaATTEbmgWPjIHZZ7pP2KUULjlSquc7QHeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Puo82Z16EQjrUwNHYHyNSYWpHCAxfgLRY5XAQSQrTkg&oe=6A203C87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ph18tUpd9o8Q7kNvwEGlz-J&_nc_oc=Adp5SJK_EdvWQJBHrlANsGVOQgFA4wzZK3RLBTcik5FeuELvlZvm-ZbghsPbneTWO_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5gstSmFWpsExPBOzRj_itXgN8LrXUJsENO4qAxXoibVQ&oe=6A202855"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X1eWGP-I19sQ7kNvwF3T2bY&_nc_oc=AdpZWxmZP7v_smR92RMrko709p92gEcTmThuXf_9LmDTNGq6nX1gCh20ILMZr2Xukj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5A5_wMesFMmT8F0k7oLAz_AoSHdV3vuhVRsKnPfAcZvw&oe=6A2034E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.